li>Late or missed payments may result in additional fees. Please ensure you can meet your payment obligations before selecting Klarna.</li><li>For more information or assistance, visit Klarna’s website or contact their customer support.</li><li>By selecting Klarna at checkout, you agree to Klarna’s terms and conditions.</li></ul><p>If you have any questions regarding Klarna payments for your Amun Organics order, feel free to contact us at <strong>[insert contact email]</strong>.</p>"}],
